@baseUrl = https://localhost:7176
@token = replace-with-private-order-guid

### Guest order status requires the private token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{token}}/status

### Numeric order IDs require owner or admin authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/status

### Obtain upload CSRF token (admin cookie required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/uploads/security

### Subscribe using the antiforgery hidden field and cookie from the product page
POST {{baseUrl}}/stock-notifications
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

variantId=1&email=shopper%40example.test&__RequestVerificationToken=replace-with-form-token

### Review pending moderation (antiforgery cookie and form token required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Name=Test+Shopper&Rating=5&Comment=A+helpful+and+detailed+review&__RequestVerificationToken=replace-with-form-token

### Confirm subscription (use actual subscription token and form token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/stock-notifications/{{token}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

__RequestVerificationToken=replace-with-form-token

### Unsubscribe
POST {{baseUrl}}/stock-notifications/{{token}}/unsubscribe
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

__RequestVerificationToken=replace-with-form-token
